{"_id":"vwTzUbkzdKXPZXkG","name":"Eternal Lord","type":"armour","system":{"equipped":false,"evasion":0,"defence":7,"description":"Glass Buckler This shield is made of a transparent material that does not obstruct the view of the wearer and allows them to stand at an advantage. The wearer of this shield gains a +1 bonus to Accuracy checks. Once the wearer fails an Evasion check, the shield becomes cracked and blocks vision, and the bonus is lost. If the wearer fails the Evasion check again with the cracked shield, the shield is completely destroyed. A cracked shield cannot be repaired, and its sale price is 10 gamel. This shield cannot be reinforced with Extra Manatite Armor (see CR III, p. 246). > Return to list Asteria's Defense While equipped, the user receives -3 applied damage from Fire-, Water/Ice-, Wind- and Earth-type sources, whether physical or magical. > Return to list Flaming Shield This shield is enveloped in fire for 10 seconds (1 round) after the wielder activates it with a Minor Action. This gives the wielder an additional +1 bonus to Evasion checks against melee attacks (+2 combined with the shield's original bonus). It also reduces received Water/Ice type damage by -2 points. A melee attack from a character with [〇Fire Immunity] does not gain the bonus to Evasion check from the shield's flame. While the shield is wrapped in fire, the wielder suffers 1d Fire fixed damage on each of their turns. > Return to list Balzer's Magilight Shield This is one of the Balzer's Magitech Arms. With Balzer's Magic Sword, mana is absorbed from the attack target, stored, and released when needed to deal damage. If the wielder hits a target with Balzer's Magic Sword, the shield stores 1 point of mana, up to a maximum of 4 points. The wielder can declare the release of this mana with a Minor Action at any time in their turn. Once released, the shield can deal Energy magic damage to \"Target: 1 Character\" within \"Range: Touch\" with \"Resistance: Can't\". This damage depends on the amount of mana stored at the time.","magicalDefence":0,"quantity":1,"minStrength":24,"notes":"Glass Buckler This shield is made of a transparent material that does not obstruct the view of the wearer and allows them to stand at an advantage. The wearer of this shield gains a +1 bonus to Accuracy checks. Once the wearer fails an Evasion check, the shield becomes cracked and blocks vision, and the bonus is lost. If the wearer fails the Evasion check again with the cracked shield, the shield is completely destroyed. A cracked shield cannot be repaired, and its sale price is 10 gamel. This shield cannot be reinforced with Extra Manatite Armor (see CR III, p. 246). > Return to list Asteria's Defense While equipped, the user receives -3 applied damage from Fire-, Water/Ice-, Wind- and Earth-type sources, whether physical or magical. > Return to list Flaming Shield This shield is enveloped in fire for 10 seconds (1 round) after the wielder activates it with a Minor Action. This gives the wielder an additional +1 bonus to Evasion checks against melee attacks (+2 combined with the shield's original bonus). It also reduces received Water/Ice type damage by -2 points. A melee attack from a character with [〇Fire Immunity] does not gain the bonus to Evasion check from the shield's flame. While the shield is wrapped in fire, the wielder suffers 1d Fire fixed damage on each of their turns. > Return to list Balzer's Magilight Shield This is one of the Balzer's Magitech Arms. With Balzer's Magic Sword, mana is absorbed from the attack target, stored, and released when needed to deal damage. If the wielder hits a target with Balzer's Magic Sword, the shield stores 1 point of mana, up to a maximum of 4 points. The wielder can declare the release of this mana with a Minor Action at any time in their turn. Once released, the shield can deal Energy magic damage to \"Target: 1 Character\" within \"Range: Touch\" with \"Resistance: Can't\". This damage depends on the amount of mana stored at the time.","sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/items:shields","racialGearRace":""},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","effects":[],"sort":0}
